@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<section class="hero-section">
    <div class="hero-glass text-start">

        <h1 class="hero-title mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p class="hero-subtitle">
            This Privacy Policy explains how Furniture &amp; Garden Design
            ("we", "our", or "the Platform") collects, processes, and protects
            your personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws,
            including the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), where applicable.
        </p>

        <hr class="my-4" />

        <h4>1. Data Controller</h4>
        <p>
            Furniture &amp; Garden Design acts as the data controller for
            personal data collected through this platform.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">2. Information We Collect</h4>
        <p>We may collect and process the following categories of data:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Account data (email address, username)</li>
            <li>Authentication-related information</li>
            <li>Order details, including dimensions, descriptions, and uploaded reference images</li>
            <li>Usage data related to interactions within the platform</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="mt-4">3. Purpose of Processing</h4>
        <p>Your personal data is processed for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Providing and maintaining your user account</li>
            <li>Processing custom furniture and garden design requests</li>
            <li>Generating AI-assisted design concepts</li>
            <li>Improving platform functionality and user experience</li>
            <li>Ensuring platform security and preventing misuse</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="mt-4">4. Legal Basis for Processing</h4>
        <p>
            Processing of personal data is based on:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>The performance of a contract (providing requested services)</li>
            <li>Legitimate interest in maintaining and improving the platform</li>
            <li>Compliance with legal obligations, where applicable</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="mt-4">5. AI-Generated Content</h4>
        <p>
            Uploaded images and descriptions are processed solely for generating
            requested design concepts. These materials are not sold or shared with
            third parties for advertising purposes.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">6. Data Storage and Security</h4>
        <p>
            We implement appropriate technical and organizational security measures
            to protect personal data against unauthorized access, loss, alteration,
            or disclosure. Access to administrative functions is restricted.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">7. Data Retention</h4>
        <p>
            Personal data is retained only for as long as necessary to provide the
            requested services or to comply with legal obligations.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">8. User Rights</h4>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Request access to your personal data</li>
            <li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
            <li>Request restriction of processing</li>
            <li>Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="mt-4">9. Cookies</h4>
        <p>
            The platform uses essential cookies required for authentication and secure
            operation. No tracking, analytics, or advertising cookies are used.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">10. Changes to This Policy</h4>
        <p>
            We reserve the right to update this Privacy Policy at any time.
            Updated versions will be published on this page with a revised date.
        </p>

        <h4 class="mt-4">11. Contact Information</h4>
        <p>
            For any privacy-related questions or data access requests,
            please contact us through the platform.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-5 text-muted">
            Last updated: February 2026
        </p>

    </div>
</section>
